    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Verify whether RocksDBMetrics Get Measurements from RocksDB in a Unit Test instead of an Intergration Test",
    "description": "The integration test {{RocksDBMetricsIntegrationTest}} takes pretty long to complete. The main part of the runtime is spent in the two tests that verify whether the rocksDB metrics get actual measurements from RocksDB. Those tests need to wait for the thread that collects the measurements of the RocksDB metrics to trigger the first recordings of the metrics. These tests do not need to run as integration tests and thus they shall be converted into unit tests to save runtime.",
